caption: Cultivation
tradition-component: cultivation

Cultivation is a single body-and-mind perfection family. When it opens:

Increase the character's natural Species cap for every primary attribute and secondary characteristic by 2 × current Duan Wei. Apply this before Martial Attribute Development, Affinity, Transformation cap comparisons, or Martial Paragon. This grants no free levels.

ST, DX, IQ, HT, and every Cultivated Excellence advantage become Kung Fu Training Traits.

Cultivated Excellence: Ambidexterity, Flexibility, Combat Reflexes, Catfall, Perfect Balance, Enhanced Block, Enhanced Dodge, Enhanced Parry, Enhanced Move, Super Jump, Super Climbing, Walk on Air, Extra Attack, Enhanced Time Sense, Acute Senses, Danger Sense, Enhanced Tracking, Dark Vision, See Invisible, Sensitivity, Vibration Sense, DR with Tough Skin, Fit, Very Fit, High Pain Threshold, Hard to Kill, Hard to Subdue, Rapid Healing, Recovery, Regeneration, Regrowth, Resistant, Breath-Holding, Doesn't Breathe, Doesn't Eat or Drink, Metabolism Control, Temperature Tolerance, Pressure Support, Vacuum Support, Reduced Consumption, Reduced Sleep, Doesn't Sleep, Unaging, Indomitable, Unfazeable, Intuition, Visualization, Silence, and Protected Sense.

Enhanced Block, Enhanced Dodge, and ordinary Enhanced Parry are each limited to one level through Cultivation. Regeneration is limited to Fast (1 HP/minute). Cultivation grants no Flight, Lifting ST, Striking ST, Compartmentalized Mind, Supernatural Durability, or Unkillable.

Only Affinity Attributes receive Style Shido discounts among raw attributes and secondary characteristics. Cultivated Excellence advantages may receive applicable Style Shido. Other attribute increases are full price unless another rule says otherwise.

Cultivation grants no Energy Reserve or external power system and affects only the practitioner.
